    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We cut to the interior of the Kanda family apartment several hours later — where both Kanda daughters are seated in different positions on the couch, meant to emphasize their respective mental states.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The youngest daughter was wide open, the way she always is. Her feet dangled in the air like the hands of a corpse hanging off the twin-size bed of a necrophiliac deep in the act of persistent postmortem coitus.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her sister, on the other hand, took up a more reserved posture — hugging her knees with both arms in a way that didn’t just allow her to use them as a pillow, but made her feel more comfortable and protected.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She didn’t think her little sister was going to rape her, though — so she wasn’t really sure just what she was protecting herself from at the moment.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thoughts, perhaps? Did she fear that the man she encountered earlier would return after misinterpreting her final line? No. That was unlikely. She probably won’t see him again for another several weeks.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yet she mourned his absence from the halls of her school. The way she used to look over her shoulder before turning every corner to try and spot him somewhere.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He’d seldom spot her back. In fact, she’d seldom spot him at all. But every time she did, it made her heart skip a beat. And it still skipped some nights, but she hated that it did that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She hated that it did that, and she hated it because it meant she was right about something. She was right about how some things are too good to be true, and he was always one of them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He wasn’t kind or caring. He wasn’t attentive. He didn’t like the things she did and had spent way too much time with the other girl on the couch. There was never really anything good about him at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "His flaws were so evident now — and all it took was a brush with death to pry the blindness from her eyes and change everything.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She wished it would all change back, though. And somewhere it did — but that somewhere was not here, for this wish had already been made.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And all that was left to do was sit here hugging her knees while waiting for the couch to swallow her whole.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it just me, or is Tom Holland, like...weirdly hot?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hot? I didn’t think he’d be your type at all.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really have a type. I see beauty in everyone, I think. Just, in his case, I want him to take me to his room and-",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin, stop.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage2.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop what? I was just gonna say “read me a bedtime story and pat my head.”",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...Sorry.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re usually more...abrasive than that.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everything okay? You’ve seemed a little off all night.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage3.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re...actually asking?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. I’m good Kirin now. I’ve decided to switch personalities.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can just...do that?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It helps not having any idea what your identity is or even what you like. So you’d probably struggle with it.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage4.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mm...darn it. That’s exactly what I want right now too.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean? What could perfect, beautiful, wonderful Karin Kanda possibly want to change about herself?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wish I was less nice.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage5.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...why?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It makes me weak...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I keep feeling bad about stuff I shouldn’t feel bad about and everything would be so much easier right now if I just...knew how to hold a grudge.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t want to be thinking about second chances. I want to just move on. But I keep second guessing myself and I just feel...like I’m doing the wrong thing when deep down, I know I’m not.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage6",
