      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage6.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm...",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry if none of that made sense. I’m just really confused right now. But thank you for asking, Kirin. It helps.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know...this is kind of annoying.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I knew you wouldn’t like talking to me. But I’m grateful you tried anyway.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage7.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not that. Just you and Noriko are, like...weirdly identical when it comes to this whole “sit back and sulk” stuff. And it’s annoying because I wish you two would just do what you want for a change.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what I want is to not feel bad about being mean and every time I’m mean, I just...feel bad. Obviously.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then just don’t be mean. Problem solved. That sort of thing doesn’t fit you anyway.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if I’m not mean, how am I supposed to...keep people away from me?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sistermassage8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sistermassage8.webp",
      "alt": "sistermassage8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You coooould...file a restraining order?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...I’d rather keep this private. I don’t even want to get you involved. I just feel like I’m going to explode if I don’t try to talk about it, though.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you can tell me whatever you want. And I’m not going to, like...ridicule you or...get anyone else involved if that’s what you’re worried about.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not...but thank you again.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Karin, chances are I probably already know what this is about right now. So if you just come out and say it-",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just need to...stop being so weak...and stick to my guns.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I always...think I’m doing a good job.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But then every time I walk away, there’s this...feeling in my chest that, like...stays with me for the rest of the day. It spills into the next day too sometimes.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And if that’s going to happen every single time, maybe it would make sense to just, like...stop caring about it?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
